# wtf_mosley — "WTF Mosley?" (Quest 5)
#
# The player confronts Councillor Mosley about the vapes. The whole beat is one conversation, so the
# quest is a single MANUAL stage that Mosley's dialogue completes — a TALKTO last stage would
# complete on the interact, before Mosley says a word, and skip the confession (see
# daniel_pauls_quest_one for the same reasoning).
#
# GRANTED BY: Daniel's report at the end of the Quest 4 arc — quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest,
# node dbb_chat, whose choice completes deliver_the_big_blue and grants this quest.
#
# COMPLETED BY: Mosley's closing choice in quests/dialogue/councillormosley.quest, gated active
# wtf_mosley.
#
# Mosley's closing choice also GRANTs Quest 6 (gangbusters), written 2026-08-16. His line there
# already named "a little place near the abandoned bus station" — that place is the trap house.

QUEST wtf_mosley
TITLE: WTF Mosley?
GIVER: Councillor Mosley
LOCATION: Councillor Mosley's spot, London.

STAGE MANUAL
OBJECTIVE: Find Ralph and Sanjeet. Maybe Mosley can help...

REWARD
XP: 30
